>>> nice addition to dplyr and it fits in well with how dplyr works. However, it
>>> may not always be the best way to rename variables. The plyr package also
>>> has a rename() function, and it uses R's built-in names() function. So if
>>> you had a large data set and all you wanted to do was rename some variables
