MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset="utf-8"
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Hi all,

I've got a bleeding edge extension of dplyr methods for MS SQL Server in RSQLServer <https://github.com/imanuelcostigan/RSQLServer/tree/feature/dplyr>. I've tested this on one of our SQL Servers and the key methods work (mostly). It's using the jTDS drivers so it should work with MS SQL Server version 8+ (i.e. MS SQL Server 2000 +).

I would appreciate any further testing by other users of SQL Server, new issues <https://github.com/imanuelcostigan/RSQLServer/issues> for bugs and pull requests for any fixes / improvements. I am hoping to introduce a test harness soon.

To install:

devtools::install_github("imanuelcostigan/RSQLServer@feature/dplyr")

Thanks!

